# Copy to .env.local (never commit real values). Everything is optional:
# without DATABASE_URL the app runs exactly as before (in-memory + .cache/oportunidades.json).

# Postgres (Supabase) connection string. Supabase dashboard -> Connect -> Connection string.
#  - Web app on serverless (Vercel...): the pooled "Transaction pooler" string (port 6543).
#    src/lib/db.ts already sets prepare: false, which the transaction pooler requires.
#  - GitHub Actions ingest + nightly pg_dump, migrations, local scripts: the "Session pooler" string
#    (port 5432 on *.pooler.supabase.com). The "Direct connection" also works for migrations/pg_dump,
#    but it is IPv6-only on Supabase and GitHub runners have no IPv6.
# Example: postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
DATABASE_URL=
